{"meta":{"id":"err-archive:1609838092","type":"series","name":"Meie õpetajad","poster":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/11/06/3078342h78b4t80.jpg","background":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/11/14/3087816he6eat48.jpg","genres":["ETV saated"],"description":"Esimeses osas räägime Anna Vesperiga, kes töötab Tallinna Vabaduse koolis, kus õpetab eesti keelt Ukraina lastele. Anna on endine tervishoiutöötaja, kuid paar aastat tagasi tegi ta oma karjääris põhjaliku kannapöörde. Teda innustab soov anda oma panus haridusse, ajal, mil Eestis tuntakse teravat õpetajate puudust. Saatejuht Uljana Kuzmina, režissöör Märten Vaher, toimetaja Jevgenia Volohhonskaja, produtsent Egle Beek.","videos":[{"id":"err-archive:1609838095","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/11/14/3087816h1137t34.jpg","released":"2025-10-23"},{"id":"err-archive:1609847839","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/11/14/3087798hf845t34.jpg","released":"2025-11-04"},{"id":"err-archive:1609851160","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/11/14/3087837hf571t34.jpg","released":"2025-11-06"},{"id":"err-archive:1609851163","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/11/24/3100038ha66ft34.png","released":"2025-11-06"},{"id":"err-archive:1609864282","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/12/01/3108825he933t34.png","released":"2025-11-21"},{"id":"err-archive:1609870411","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/12/08/3117925ha170t34.png","released":"2025-11-28"},{"id":"err-archive:1609876772","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2025/12/15/3124603h3325t34.png","released":"2025-12-04"},{"id":"err-archive:1609882964","title":"Meie õpetajad","season":1,"episode